1. She is a British VTuber based in England. (Verbatim: "Elias, the baria, British VTuber back in England being all British.")
2. She recently traveled to America and then to Japan before returning to England. (Verbatim: "I was away I went to America and then I went to Japan.")
3. She experiences jet lag after international travel, affecting her energy and voice. (Verbatim: "I'm jet lagged like crazy I'm jet lagged I'm so jet lagged so if you're hearing an ep voice um it's because it's ep.")
4. She has a chibi form that appears when she is away on trips. (Verbatim: "yeah it's me you miss chibi ellie i don't think you will because you know when you see her again it means i'm off on another trip.")
5. She uses cola, specifically Coke Zero, as a perceived remedy when feeling unwell. (Verbatim: "um cola um sugar uh not even sugar it's coke zero caffeine... it's my medicine.")
6. She refers to her audience as part of her "medicine," indicating emotional reliance on viewer support. (Verbatim: "medicine one cola medicine two you guys.")
7. She is prone to making logistical mistakes while traveling, such as booking hotels for incorrect dates. (Verbatim: "i didn't book the hotel long enough... i had to find a different hotel.")
8. She struggles with numbers and planning, which has led to travel difficulties. (Verbatim: "numbers are hard... the math wasn't mapping.")
9. She had planned a collab with Speaker Kitty in Japan that fell through due to travel issues. (Verbatim: "one of the things that was supposed to be blood but did not happen was supposed to be an off collab with the wonderful... Speaker Kitty.")
10. She has technical difficulties with electronics, including a laptop that died and couldn't be repaired. (Verbatim: "rest in peace laptop chan... it be borked it cannot be fixed.") [end of text]



1. She has at least one younger brother who is studying computer science. (Verbatim: "My younger brother studying computer science and was good advice for him to think about.")

2. She humorously identifies as a cat, and expresses a desire to find a raccoon. (Verbatim: "raccoon i am a cat hello cats and i will find a raccoon one day i heckin will")

3. She has multiple siblings and jokes that they were all raised by the same parents, implying a shared quirky family background. (Verbatim: "me and my brothers so kind of doomed from the start")

4. She does not take good care of herself and describes herself as a mess. (Verbatim: "i'm still terrible looking after myself a complete mess and absolutely broken")

5. She has a self-deprecating view of her personality, calling herself "cringe" and in need of improvement. (Verbatim: "I am very much an embodiment of cringe like no no not my cringe stories")

6. She expresses a desire to become marketable enough to have plushies or figurines made of herself. (Verbatim: "if i ever become a marketable marketable plush would you eat me")

