6. She expresses difficulty staying hydrated and questions the common advice of drinking two or 2.5 liters of water a day. (Verbatim: "how much am i supposed to drink a day... do people really have their two liters of water wait is it supposed to be 2.5")

7. She once fell asleep while chatting with the Vdata girls and snorted, which they later told her about, though she doesn’t remember it. (Verbatim: "apparently I have fallen asleep and snorted them before... I don't remember doing that at all")

8. She has ongoing personal matters to sort out in England. (Verbatim: "I spend time in England to sort out a bunch of personal stuffs. So, I got stuffs to sort out.")

9. She refers to her fans as her “happy place” and deeply values their support, especially after returning from a break. (Verbatim: "Thanks for being my happy place"; "Thank you just being here and spending any time with me")

10. She aspires to do “Pew Pew” in the future, which seems to be a planned event or activity she was unable to organize this time. (Verbatim: "I will Pew Pew. I will.") [end of text]



