10. She has visited multiple countries including America, Japan, and England, and has observed cultural differences such as jaywalking laws and road sizes. (Verbatim: "going from one to the other is that like the roads are giant like america's so big... first thing i did back in england was i saw a road and i was like no wait i can just cross") [end of text]



