1. Her fictional origin story is that she was hit by a truck on her way to Earth and reincarnated as a British girl. (Verbatim: "Yo, my lore is I got hit by a truck on my way to earth and got isekai'd as a British girl.")

2. She has a deep fear of heights and roller coasters, stemming from childhood trauma. (Verbatim: "I'm not very good with roller coasters at all. I'm scared to even go on swings.")

3. Her fear of roller coasters was intensified by her mother, Mama Elia, who graphically described how roller coasters could kill her. (Verbatim: "Mama Elia would go into detail, she would be like, 'This grill is what would come loose and this is how it would break...'")

4. She was told these frightening descriptions at a very young age, which caused lasting trauma. (Verbatim: "And I was told that when I was really young. We're talking like... like literal child. So... woop! Trauma!")

5. She believes her mother’s warnings may have been a money-saving tactic to avoid going to theme parks. (Verbatim: "I think it was some kind of money-saving tactic, but at the expense of your child's mental...")

6. She has a freeze response in stressful situations instead of fight or flight. (Verbatim: "I don't have a fight or flight instinct, I have a freeze instinct. So I just sat there blankly while my soul left my body.")

7. She successfully faced her fear by riding two roller coasters in Japan, including one that was once the world's tallest with a 70-meter drop. (Verbatim: "I went on this, I went on this... it was the world's tallest roller coaster, once upon a time... it had the largest drop in the world, so it's at 70 meters.")

8. During one roller coaster ride, she kept her eyes open but remained completely silent while dissociating. (Verbatim: "I kept my eyes open... I was silent the whole ride while Ruby was screaming, so much.")

9. She has a brother named Ellie Bro (or Elia Bro), with whom she plans to collaborate on a stream. (Verbatim: "on my donathon one of the rewards was a collab with my brother... we're trying to decide between two options now.")

10. She keeps an organized list of future stream ideas and rewards, including ASMR Week, Ring Fit, and letting chat pick her next cover. (Verbatim: "i have the list i have the list... asmr week ring fit week nana elia's honest review... letting chat pick my next cover") [end of text]



